<title>BERMUDA: FIGURE SKATING-CHAMPIONS SERIES FINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>FIGURE SKATING-CHAMPIONS SERIES FINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>HAMILTON, Ontario 1997-03-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading results</p>
<p>after Saturday's competition at the Champions Series Final</p>
<p>figure skating:</p>
<p>Dance final standings</p>
<p>1. Shae-Lynn Bourne/Victor Kraatz (Canada)</p>
<p>2. Anjelika Krylova/Oleg Ovsiannikov (Russia)</p>
<p>3. Marina Anissina/Gwendal Peizerat (France)</p>
<p>4. Irina Romanova/Igor Yarashenko (Ukraine)</p>
<p>5. Irina Lobacheva/Ilia Averbukh (Russia)</p>
<p>Pairs final standings</p>
<p>1. Mandy Wotzel/Ingo Steuer (Germany)</p>
<p>2. Oksana Kazakova/Artur Dmitriev (Russia)</p>
<p>3. Marina Eltsova/Andrei Bushkov (Russia)</p>
<p>Did not finish - Jenni Meno/Todd Sand (U.S.) withdrew due to</p>
<p>injury</p>
</text>
